# Table of particles for DEGAS-2

$Id$

# Particles are made of a aggregates of the elementary particles.  Each
# particle is represented by two lines.  The first is the full name of the
# particle.  THe second is a blank-delimited sequence of entries of the form
# name count-1 element-1 count-2 element-2, etc.

geometry
0  1 0
electron
e  1 e
atomic hydrogen
H  1 H
molecular hydrogen
H2 2 H
hydrogen ion
H+ 1 H -1 e
